## DNS proxy selection

Select an existing shared proxy using `dns_settings.dns_proxy_object` instead
of `dns_settings.servers`. Configure exactly one of these when `dns_settings`
is provided. The proxy must have cache and EDNS cache enabled for queries
originating from the firewall. Existing server-based configurations remain
supported. Selecting a proxy updates candidate configuration only; commit and
push follow the operator's normal workflow.

```terraform
resource "panos_dns_settings" "split_dns" {
  location = {
    template = { name = "firewall-template" }
  }
  dns_settings = {
    # Name of an existing shared DNS proxy in this template.
    dns_proxy_object = "existing-shared-dns-proxy"
  }
}
```

